{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16224410","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16224410","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1622441001:1":{"text":"북풍, 북풍이야! 북풍이 포효할 때, 날개를 펼쳐라!","source_cn":"啾咕咕……北风！是北风！北风呼啸之时，张开你的翅膀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA77786F9ECED0414","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1622441002:1":{"text":"따뜻하면서도 힘찬 바람... 분명 선조님께서 저희의 용기에 응답하신 거겠죠. 감사합니다, 숲의 숨결님!","source_cn":"这风……温暖而有力，一定是先祖回应了我们的勇气！感谢您...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB877FDB8662BEC7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1622441003:1":{"text":"희망을 준 것은 선조도 나도 아니야. 절망 속에서 스스로 낸 용기와 너희의 날개지.","source_cn":"给予你们希望的不是先祖或我，而是你们自己在绝境中唤醒的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36B9CDD11B5EE1C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1622441004:1":{"text":"나는 본래 숲의 숨결인 북풍을 조금 일찍 깨워준 것뿐이다.","source_cn":"这股北风，本就孕育于这片森林的呼吸，我只是提前将它唤醒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6027B2FE7733A743","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1622441005:1":{"text":"이제, 겨울 보금자리를 찾아 남쪽으로 날아가거라.","source_cn":"飞吧，去南方建立你们的冬季家园。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C126CA1A66D764E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1622441005":{"text":"이제, 겨울 보금자리를 찾아 남쪽으로 날아가거라.","source_cn":"飞吧，去南方建立你们的冬季家园。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C126CA1A66D764E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1622441006:0":{"text":"네! 세 분, 내년 봄바람이 불 때 다시 뵐게요!","source_cn":"嗯！三位，希望来年春风时，我们能再次相遇！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA261559D8FCF88AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:12:1622441007:0":{"text":"거센 북풍의 도움을 받아 철새 떼는 날개를 펼치고 힘차게 남쪽 하늘을 향해 날아갔다.","source_cn":"在强劲的北风助力下，候鸟群振翅而起，坚定地飞向南方天际。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x686B2BAF8C570812","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"힘차게 날아봐!","source_cn":"振翅高飞吧！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7A6AE35CB63E1DA9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"힘차게 날아봐!","female":"힘차게 날아봐!","variant_male_record_index":"86679","variant_female_record_index":"86680","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:1:2":{"text":"다음에 다시 만나!","source_cn":"未来再会！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAE763F8D7ECEB6A8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"다음에 다시 만나!","female":"다음에 다시 만나!","variant_male_record_index":"86681","variant_female_record_index":"86682","document_title":""